06%EF%BC%BF071030%EF%BC%BFNAVER.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1080\", \"originalHeight\" : \"1720\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDAyMDZfMzUg/MDAxNzA3MTgxMDI1MjYy.dFfEb3xArdcC7jbxlTR3L9NtZg91UKjGUPXLggipZyIg.RApT5RgNRjSr5gp-16B3DZnCAQiyjedvWH74ChiiDkIg.JPEG/Screenshot%EF%BC%BF20240206%EF%BC%BF071030%EF%BC%BFNAVER.jpg?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d8cc7c72-c488-11ee-b482-1132fa2ab1c5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-abe2ea9f-c48a-11ee-b482-4be8dd4f4a2e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-36916e70-c48c-11ee-b482-d3513f52768b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1af14928-c48c-11ee-b482-5d37c46a945f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-36916e72-c48c-11ee-b482-a33b89d80484\">극적인 상황을 요약해서 (좋은 극적임인지 안좋은 극적임인지 정도만 이야기함) 사람들의 궁금증을 유발한 다음 간단하게 해당 상황을 설명하고 있네요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1af14929-c48c-11ee-b482-3d5eef1cf5a4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-36916e74-c48c-11ee-b482-89c0bb963590\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1af1492b-c48c-11ee-b482-c5ed4b12abeb\"><span style=\"\" c